SOAPBOX: Good conditions throughout, though 10M never really got going again on the Sunday after a reasonable opening on Saturday. Running 200w into wire antennas, I thought I'd struggle with all the big signals out there but after the first 12 hours, things settled down and I had a lot of fun working 100 DXCC entities in the end. I did S&P for mults only throughout. It was a fun and very productive weekend. Thanks to everyone for their patience, good ears friendliness and courtesy.
